&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KYXnrvAkSoUQ7kNvwHnBUtB&_nc_oc=AdoFbXMv7BT8A18amHXTxGZAzSDzdDxNK_roizzDMpu8t2aEH_YEsqrxDgigpqFuBbs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSzMxH2TM-wQnGQB_MBbYYra0XF0o5-Yf8Y7JcStHdquQ&oe=6B09A99A"}, "display_name": "Stealthy Swipers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Description:\nImmerse yourself in the thrilling world of \"Stealthy Swipers,\" a cutting-edge VR game where your mission is to \"borrow\" valuable items from a vast, high-tech environment while evading detection by the colossal room owner. This game combines intense stealth mechanics, strategic gameplay, and a rich, futuristic setting to deliver an unforgettable virtual reality experience.\n\nGame Features:\n\n    Immersive VR Environment:\n        Experience a meticulously crafted, enormous space brought to life with state-of-the-art VR graphics. The game environment is designed to be visually stunning and deeply immersive, making you feel like you are truly inside a high-tech, futuristic world.\n\n    Stealth and Strategy Gameplay:\n        Engage in challenging stealth gameplay that requires careful planning and quick reflexes. Utilize shadows, create diversions, and use high-tech gadgets to avoid being detected by the vigilant room owner.", "short_description": "Description:\nImmerse yourself in the thrilling world of \"Stealthy Swipers,\" a cutting-edge VR game where your mission is to \"borrow\" valuable items from a vast, high-tech environment while evading detection by the colossal room owner. This game combines intense stealth mechanics, strategic gameplay, and a rich, futuristic setting to deliver an unforgettable virtual reality experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/stealthyswipers/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "FQWEFWQ Invention", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google